    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21889" root="شخر" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِخِّيرٌ</span></b>  <i>That utters much,</i> or <i>often, the sound</i>
termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخِير</span>: (K:) or, as in some copies of the
K [and in the O], <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَخِير</span>: (TA:) [see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخَرَ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَخَرَ</span>:] applied to an ass in this sense, (O,) or as
signifying <i>vociferous.</i> (TA.)

